Also need to assign operator resource and confirm alignment (requires constraint_applied first). So we need to apply operational constraint to alpha, then assign operator, then confirm alignment.

Also need to verify compliance certificate for alpha (verify_compliance_certificate) which requires operator_alignment_confirmed and candidate_compliance_certificate_linked (we need to assign compliance certificate to alpha? Actually goal does not require compliance_certificate_linked for alpha; only needs compliance_validation_complete. The verify_compliance_certificate action requires candidate_compliance_certificate_linked ?candidate ?compliance_certificate. So we need to link a compliance certificate to alpha. We have compliance_certificate_alpha available. We can assign it to alpha, then verify.

Thus for alpha:
